   "id": "introduction",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Appliance energy: ten neural-network configurations\n",
    "\n",
    "This project estimates appliance energy during a measured ten-minute interval. The final model is Run 9, the 256-bin network, because it has the lowest mean validation RMSE among the ten configurations. The comparison is exploratory: the reference test partition was inspected during development, and the three validation partitions reuse a schedule selected from the same training pool.\n",
    "\n",
   ]
  },
  {
